{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-note-template-js","path":"/herringbone ring/","result":{"pageContext":{"id":"a473a863-0da5-5990-926c-0143acd6599f","html":"<h1>herringbone ring</h1>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 590px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/eaedadfb0a0b65231ecefff82bfe7314/d3c45/herringbone-ring-done-1.jpg\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.1081081081081%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"a brass ring with a herringbone pattern\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/eaedadfb0a0b65231ecefff82bfe7314/1c72d/herringbone-ring-done-1.jpg\"\n        srcset=\"/static/eaedadfb0a0b65231ecefff82bfe7314/a80bd/herringbone-ring-done-1.jpg 148w,\n/static/eaedadfb0a0b65231ecefff82bfe7314/1c91a/herringbone-ring-done-1.jpg 295w,\n/static/eaedadfb0a0b65231ecefff82bfe7314/1c72d/herringbone-ring-done-1.jpg 590w,\n/static/eaedadfb0a0b65231ecefff82bfe7314/a8a14/herringbone-ring-done-1.jpg 885w,\n/static/eaedadfb0a0b65231ecefff82bfe7314/fbd2c/herringbone-ring-done-1.jpg 1180w,\n/static/eaedadfb0a0b65231ecefff82bfe7314/d3c45/herringbone-ring-done-1.jpg 3472w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 590px) 100vw, 590px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>i made this as the final project of my first jewelry-making class! i am very happy with how it turned out, and very thankful that i am in a position where i can do stuff like this.</p>\n<h2>the process</h2>\n<p>i actually had the idea for this right after signing up for the class, so i was pretty much ready to go with it when our instructor told us to pick a 'final project'. my initial idea was to have all of the wires that form the pattern be soldered and bent without a backing, but she told me that probably wouldn't work - the hammering and bending was likely to cause issues.</p>\n<p>instead, she recommended that i sweat solder it. i had not done that before but it is a simple process:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>put solder on a flat backing piece and melt it on</li>\n<li>place smaller pieces on top after the flat part is pickled</li>\n<li>re-flux it all, melt the solder again with the flat pieces on top</li>\n</ol>\n<p>at home the next week, i took care of cutting about ~120 short pieces of wire (only ended up using ~90) and filing one end of them flat.</p>\n<p>so the steps are not complex, but it was tricky to get the pieces lined up right. i used the end of a (fire brick? don't remember what this is called - the tile that you place stuff on when soldering) to get a 90 degree angle for the first pieces.</p>\n<p>then i did about 10 wire pieces at a time. i had a few mistakes that i needed to adjust, including an over-heating near the end that fused the wire to the backing plate that i had to grind off, but it turned out ok, if a bit uneven.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 590px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/cda78f137ab7dede5457a4727d6f6187/d3c45/herringbone-ring-flat.jpg\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.1081081081081%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"a strip of annealed brass wire in a herringbone pattern on a backing plate\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/cda78f137ab7dede5457a4727d6f6187/1c72d/herringbone-ring-flat.jpg\"\n        srcset=\"/static/cda78f137ab7dede5457a4727d6f6187/a80bd/herringbone-ring-flat.jpg 148w,\n/static/cda78f137ab7dede5457a4727d6f6187/1c91a/herringbone-ring-flat.jpg 295w,\n/static/cda78f137ab7dede5457a4727d6f6187/1c72d/herringbone-ring-flat.jpg 590w,\n/static/cda78f137ab7dede5457a4727d6f6187/a8a14/herringbone-ring-flat.jpg 885w,\n/static/cda78f137ab7dede5457a4727d6f6187/fbd2c/herringbone-ring-flat.jpg 1180w,\n/static/cda78f137ab7dede5457a4727d6f6187/d3c45/herringbone-ring-flat.jpg 3472w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 590px) 100vw, 590px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>you can see in the above picture the fused piece i was talking about on the right. this was kinda annoying to grind off.</p>\n<p>after this, i put some strips of square brass wire on top to gauge how wide i wanted the overall ring to be.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 590px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/cb56750571d1750e3a91b42c880bbbc4/d3c45/herringbone-ring-flat-with-strips.jpg\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.1081081081081%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"annealed brass wire in herringbone pattern with square wire on top\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/cb56750571d1750e3a91b42c880bbbc4/1c72d/herringbone-ring-flat-with-strips.jpg\"\n        srcset=\"/static/cb56750571d1750e3a91b42c880bbbc4/a80bd/herringbone-ring-flat-with-strips.jpg 148w,\n/static/cb56750571d1750e3a91b42c880bbbc4/1c91a/herringbone-ring-flat-with-strips.jpg 295w,\n/static/cb56750571d1750e3a91b42c880bbbc4/1c72d/herringbone-ring-flat-with-strips.jpg 590w,\n/static/cb56750571d1750e3a91b42c880bbbc4/a8a14/herringbone-ring-flat-with-strips.jpg 885w,\n/static/cb56750571d1750e3a91b42c880bbbc4/fbd2c/herringbone-ring-flat-with-strips.jpg 1180w,\n/static/cb56750571d1750e3a91b42c880bbbc4/d3c45/herringbone-ring-flat-with-strips.jpg 3472w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 590px) 100vw, 590px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>i marked this width with a sharpie in a <em>mostly</em> straight fashion, then cut the edges of my patterned plate with a wire saw. i did not do a great job with this, so i had to spent a while trying to file it close to square. i did measure with calipers and ended up with about 0.2-0.3 mm of variance in the width.</p>\n<p>then, i hammered the plate around a mandrel to bend it, and soldered the end together, trying to carefully match the pattern on each end to form a continuous loop. i did not <em>quite</em> get that right, but i was able to file/finesse the connection point and add 2 more wire pieces to finish it up.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 590px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/6a6032e15b8776b5424d921100d56587/d3c45/herringbone-ring-looped.jpg\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.1081081081081%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"herringbone brass wire pattern soldered into a loop\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/6a6032e15b8776b5424d921100d56587/1c72d/herringbone-ring-looped.jpg\"\n        srcset=\"/static/6a6032e15b8776b5424d921100d56587/a80bd/herringbone-ring-looped.jpg 148w,\n/static/6a6032e15b8776b5424d921100d56587/1c91a/herringbone-ring-looped.jpg 295w,\n/static/6a6032e15b8776b5424d921100d56587/1c72d/herringbone-ring-looped.jpg 590w,\n/static/6a6032e15b8776b5424d921100d56587/a8a14/herringbone-ring-looped.jpg 885w,\n/static/6a6032e15b8776b5424d921100d56587/fbd2c/herringbone-ring-looped.jpg 1180w,\n/static/6a6032e15b8776b5424d921100d56587/d3c45/herringbone-ring-looped.jpg 3472w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 590px) 100vw, 590px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>you can see above the connection point -it's where the gap in the pattern is. fortunately you can probably also see that a couple more wires fill that in nicely.</p>\n<p>also, notice how <em>not</em>-square the band is. this took some effort to fix, but it didn't require me to learn anything new:</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 590px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/189c03b7bef200a3310f930f2fbc8686/d3c45/herringbone-ring-looped-2.jpg\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.1081081081081%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"herringbone ring filed square\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/189c03b7bef200a3310f930f2fbc8686/1c72d/herringbone-ring-looped-2.jpg\"\n        srcset=\"/static/189c03b7bef200a3310f930f2fbc8686/a80bd/herringbone-ring-looped-2.jpg 148w,\n/static/189c03b7bef200a3310f930f2fbc8686/1c91a/herringbone-ring-looped-2.jpg 295w,\n/static/189c03b7bef200a3310f930f2fbc8686/1c72d/herringbone-ring-looped-2.jpg 590w,\n/static/189c03b7bef200a3310f930f2fbc8686/a8a14/herringbone-ring-looped-2.jpg 885w,\n/static/189c03b7bef200a3310f930f2fbc8686/fbd2c/herringbone-ring-looped-2.jpg 1180w,\n/static/189c03b7bef200a3310f930f2fbc8686/d3c45/herringbone-ring-looped-2.jpg 3472w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 590px) 100vw, 590px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>from here, the work was simpler. i bent the square wire strips into loops and soldered them, then got everything hammered to an equal diameter on the mandrel.</p>\n<p>to finish up the soldering, i just put one of the loops on the brick, soldered the patterned piece on top, then repeated on the other side.</p>\n<p>i got these lined up well visually, but afterwards, i noticed that the tactile experience of the ring was not as good as it could be. the edge pieces were not wholly even with the middle, so when running a finger across the ring parallel to the hole, you would feel some bumps.</p>\n<p>to fix this i just spent some time filing things until it felt like putting on the ring or running a finger across the outer edge felt smooth. at this point i was happy with it, and did my sanding with a rotary tool.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 590px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/743d433e9f88af644e06d95b8776b624/d3c45/herringbone-ring-pre-polish-2.jpg\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.1081081081081%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"sanded herringbone ring\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/743d433e9f88af644e06d95b8776b624/1c72d/herringbone-ring-pre-polish-2.jpg\"\n        srcset=\"/static/743d433e9f88af644e06d95b8776b624/a80bd/herringbone-ring-pre-polish-2.jpg 148w,\n/static/743d433e9f88af644e06d95b8776b624/1c91a/herringbone-ring-pre-polish-2.jpg 295w,\n/static/743d433e9f88af644e06d95b8776b624/1c72d/herringbone-ring-pre-polish-2.jpg 590w,\n/static/743d433e9f88af644e06d95b8776b624/a8a14/herringbone-ring-pre-polish-2.jpg 885w,\n/static/743d433e9f88af644e06d95b8776b624/fbd2c/herringbone-ring-pre-polish-2.jpg 1180w,\n/static/743d433e9f88af644e06d95b8776b624/d3c45/herringbone-ring-pre-polish-2.jpg 3472w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 590px) 100vw, 590px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>from here it was just a matter of polishing it on the wheel and cleaning it off.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 590px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/471c2e99cc9e4bb41c125397aaa82f3c/d3c45/herringbone-ring-pre-clean.jpg\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.1081081081081%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"herringbone ring with polishing compound on it\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/471c2e99cc9e4bb41c125397aaa82f3c/1c72d/herringbone-ring-pre-clean.jpg\"\n        srcset=\"/static/471c2e99cc9e4bb41c125397aaa82f3c/a80bd/herringbone-ring-pre-clean.jpg 148w,\n/static/471c2e99cc9e4bb41c125397aaa82f3c/1c91a/herringbone-ring-pre-clean.jpg 295w,\n/static/471c2e99cc9e4bb41c125397aaa82f3c/1c72d/herringbone-ring-pre-clean.jpg 590w,\n/static/471c2e99cc9e4bb41c125397aaa82f3c/a8a14/herringbone-ring-pre-clean.jpg 885w,\n/static/471c2e99cc9e4bb41c125397aaa82f3c/fbd2c/herringbone-ring-pre-clean.jpg 1180w,\n/static/471c2e99cc9e4bb41c125397aaa82f3c/d3c45/herringbone-ring-pre-clean.jpg 3472w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 590px) 100vw, 590px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>after the polishing i had a lot of this compound left on the ring. i did not have that happen on my first ring, so i was a little unsure if i had done something wrong or perhaps the wheel had too much compount on it. but it cleaned up just fine!</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 590px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/eaedadfb0a0b65231ecefff82bfe7314/d3c45/herringbone-ring-done-1.jpg\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.1081081081081%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"completed herringbone ring\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/eaedadfb0a0b65231ecefff82bfe7314/1c72d/herringbone-ring-done-1.jpg\"\n        srcset=\"/static/eaedadfb0a0b65231ecefff82bfe7314/a80bd/herringbone-ring-done-1.jpg 148w,\n/static/eaedadfb0a0b65231ecefff82bfe7314/1c91a/herringbone-ring-done-1.jpg 295w,\n/static/eaedadfb0a0b65231ecefff82bfe7314/1c72d/herringbone-ring-done-1.jpg 590w,\n/static/eaedadfb0a0b65231ecefff82bfe7314/a8a14/herringbone-ring-done-1.jpg 885w,\n/static/eaedadfb0a0b65231ecefff82bfe7314/fbd2c/herringbone-ring-done-1.jpg 1180w,\n/static/eaedadfb0a0b65231ecefff82bfe7314/d3c45/herringbone-ring-done-1.jpg 3472w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 590px) 100vw, 590px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 590px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/7aea228ce2287f855289ce86592a640f/d3c45/herringbone-ring-done-close.jpg\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.1081081081081%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"completed herringbone ring\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/7aea228ce2287f855289ce86592a640f/1c72d/herringbone-ring-done-close.jpg\"\n        srcset=\"/static/7aea228ce2287f855289ce86592a640f/a80bd/herringbone-ring-done-close.jpg 148w,\n/static/7aea228ce2287f855289ce86592a640f/1c91a/herringbone-ring-done-close.jpg 295w,\n/static/7aea228ce2287f855289ce86592a640f/1c72d/herringbone-ring-done-close.jpg 590w,\n/static/7aea228ce2287f855289ce86592a640f/a8a14/herringbone-ring-done-close.jpg 885w,\n/static/7aea228ce2287f855289ce86592a640f/fbd2c/herringbone-ring-done-close.jpg 1180w,\n/static/7aea228ce2287f855289ce86592a640f/d3c45/herringbone-ring-done-close.jpg 3472w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 590px) 100vw, 590px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 590px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/9144c4aff9bfa1d526ea742b06832aaf/d3c45/herringbone-ring-done-2.jpg\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.1081081081081%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"completed herringbone ring\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/9144c4aff9bfa1d526ea742b06832aaf/1c72d/herringbone-ring-done-2.jpg\"\n        srcset=\"/static/9144c4aff9bfa1d526ea742b06832aaf/a80bd/herringbone-ring-done-2.jpg 148w,\n/static/9144c4aff9bfa1d526ea742b06832aaf/1c91a/herringbone-ring-done-2.jpg 295w,\n/static/9144c4aff9bfa1d526ea742b06832aaf/1c72d/herringbone-ring-done-2.jpg 590w,\n/static/9144c4aff9bfa1d526ea742b06832aaf/a8a14/herringbone-ring-done-2.jpg 885w,\n/static/9144c4aff9bfa1d526ea742b06832aaf/fbd2c/herringbone-ring-done-2.jpg 1180w,\n/static/9144c4aff9bfa1d526ea742b06832aaf/d3c45/herringbone-ring-done-2.jpg 3472w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 590px) 100vw, 590px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>"}},"staticQueryHashes":[],"slicesMap":{}}